flowchart TD
    A[Maintainer-selected Boston 1990, Chicago 1970 and Birmingham 2000 scans and saved synthetic demo outputs] --> B[Tracked public bundle and images]
    B --> G[GitHub Pages: main or explicit showcase branch; website only]
    G --> V[Static browser viewer]
    L[Other ignored research artifacts and optional local override] --> P[Loopback preview only]
    B --> P
    P --> V
    V --> S[Scan section: Input - Newspaper scan, city/year and original preview]
    S --> Z[Enlarge complete newspaper]
    S --> D[One continuous decorative connecting line]
    D --> Q[Search every job in the selected newspaper]
    Q --> J[Output - Extracted text: show at most three context images, featured by default]
    J --> F[Image previews with approximate source-area labels]
    F --> U[Text fallback only when no source area exists]
    V --> K[Scroll bookmark and progressive reveal]
    J --> T[Click image to open full extracted text dialog]
    T --> E[Close or Escape returns to image grid]
    Q --> C[Download job text: all matching text records as CSV with source IDs]
    J --> R[Generation input - Job posting plus matching year-specific agency prompt]
    R --> I[Left: source posting image with enlargement or text fallback]
    R --> V1[Right: inline native menus for template count, skills and experience]
    V1 --> V2[Remember per-paper/job settings, no browser inference]
    V2 --> V3{Exact saved combination available?}
    V3 -->|Yes| V4[Inspect templates: two or four genuine generated templates]
    V3 -->|No| V5[Disable button: no live generation]
    V4 --> V6[Close or Escape returns to editor; no browser inference]
    V4 --> V7[Highlight placeholders with intentional next-step hover/focus note]
    V3 -->|Exact declared placeholder fields| P1[Continue scroll: Templates become applications]
    V1 --> N1[Identity, school and date links explain population and focus its heading]
    P1 --> P2[Show every assigned resume: two side by side or four in a 2x2 grid]
    P2 --> P3[Explicit template ID per candidate; fill identity, school and date assignments]
    P3 --> P4[Brief changed-value highlight; reduced-motion fallback]
    P3 --> P5[No inference, sampling or template mutation]
    P3 --> P7[Click highlighted details for replacement presets; enlarge any resume]
    P7 --> P8[Edits clear saved evaluation and CSV; reset restores exact evaluated inputs]
    V5 --> P6[Hide population section and clear stale content]
    P3 --> E1{Saved experiment matches full generation prompts and current inputs?}
    E1 -->|Yes| E2[How does the model decide?]
    E1 -->|No| E3[Hide experiment section and clear stale result]
    E2 --> E4[Review job text and all selected typeset resumes]
    E2 --> E5[Editable hiring prompt and Run experiment button]
    E5 --> E6{Hiring prompt unchanged?}
    E6 -->|Yes| E7[Reveal saved interview decisions and explanation]
    E6 -->|No| E8[Disable playback and clear result; no live request]
    E6 -->|Original prompt and selected example validates| F1[From decisions to data: two or four rows for current settings only]
    F1 --> F2[Show resume prompt, candidate, decision, logprob and model]
    F1 --> F3[Download full-precision CSV with stable IDs and explanation]
    F1 --> F4[Take it from here: GitHub repository and researcher-owned analysis]
    E8 --> F5[Hide final table and disable download]
